  triage:title "HttpsTransport uses parallel optional fields instead of an enum" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/https_transport.rs:135-157,176-211 — HttpsTransport uses three parallel optional fields (identity, plaintext_source_host) with runtime ok_or_else invariant recovery instead of an enum-with-payload, inconsistent with the sibling ListenerSecurity enum a few lines below that already does this correctly. Reported by rust-best-practices-agent (RBP-F001), verified directly by quality-mgr." ;
